\" >Take trophy shots with your catch and store memories from your hunting trips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/24f1fbae7d17eab5a1857fb9b5c626f5.poster.avif?t=1793908705\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/24f1fbae7d17eab5a1857fb9b5c626f5.webm?t=1793908705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/24f1fbae7d17eab5a1857fb9b5c626f5.mp4?t=1793908705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER OR SOLO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or multiplayer with up to 12 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/bf035065aa32025603d8721fd5d5df31.poster.avif?t=1793908705\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/bf035065aa32025603d8721fd5d5df31.webm?t=1793908705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/bf035065aa32025603d8721fd5d5df31.mp4?t=1793908705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEAPONS AND HUNTING EQUIPMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 15 different weapons including .700 double rifle, revolver, .50 cal heavy rifle and hunting bow. Utilize a vast variety of hunting utility from callers to range finder. Purchase new equipment from the shop or find new items in loot boxes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/752900/extras/8e36cba32a35fade3132fb862fabdcf6.avif?t=1793908705\" width=616 height=2584 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOTE FROM DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our great community on Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can influence what features will be implemented into the game. We welcome any feedback and development ideas. Thank you for your support!</p>",
